## CSS Custom Properties (Theming)

All design tokens live in `packages/ui/src/styles/global.css`. Components reference variables only — never hardcode colors, spacing, or type sizes:

```css
:root {
  /* Colors */
  --color-bg: oklch(99% 0.005 270);
  --color-surface: oklch(97% 0.005 270);
  --color-border: oklch(88% 0.01 270);
  --color-text: oklch(30% 0.02 270);
  --color-text-muted: oklch(55% 0.015 270);
  --color-accent: oklch(60% 0.22 290);
  --color-accent-subtle: oklch(95% 0.04 290);

  /* Spacing scale */
  --space-1: 4px;
  --space-2: 8px;
  --space-3: 12px;
  --space-4: 16px;
  --space-6: 24px;
  --space-8: 32px;

  /* Type scale */
  --text-xs: 11px;
  --text-sm: 13px;
  --text-base: 15px;
  --text-lg: 17px;
  --text-xl: 20px;
  --text-2xl: 24px;

  /* Radius */
  --radius-sm: 4px;
  --radius-md: 6px;
  --radius-lg: 10px;
}
```

Never use hex, rgb, or hardcoded pixel values in component CSS — always reference a variable.

